characters.appearance:
He is instructed by Qian Daoliu to assist Wind Sword Sect, Black Tiger Sect, Yan and Xie Yue in ambushing Xilu City as they had been tipped off by Xilu City's Master that Xue Beng, the current emperor of Heaven Dou Empire were to meet the Star Luo Emperor in the city to propose an alliance and create a united front.

He arrives using his level 96 spirit power to pressure the soldiers of Heaven Dou Empire and Star Luo Empire, and is about to kill them using his Coiling Dragon Staff spirit, when Tang San intervenes by throwing the Clear Sky Hammer at his staff. At first, he assumes the Clear Sky Clan had come out of seclusion, but when seeing Tang San's spirit ring configuration of 2 yellow, 1 purple, 1 black and 4 red rings, he is intrigued. He then continues to fight Tang San, who uses the Clear Sky Nine Absolutes to contend with his staff. Eventually he has enough and unleashes his 9th spirit ability Restoration of the World, but is once again interrupted by Tang San, who reveals his Sea God Trident and uses his Skull Bone ability Cosmic Magic Barrier to defeat him.&lt;ref&gt;Episode 204&lt;ref&gt;&lt;ref&gt;Episode 205&lt;ref&gt;

He returns to Martial Soul Empire Douluo Hall, where he is punished by Qian Renxue, now a level 92 Titled Douluo. She uses her sacred flames to scorch him. Qian Daoliu helps him up soon after.&lt;ref&gt;Episode 205&lt;ref&gt;

