characters.appearance:
Mu Chen is a majestic man in his 40’s who is dressed in silver-grey clothes. He wears a badge on the pit of his stomach. The badge is golden in color, and has a protruding hammer design and a total of eight black stars above the hammer.&#160;

In the whole Blacksmith’s Association, he is the only eight star Saint Craftsman level blacksmith.&#160;

He is also the President of Eastsea Blacksmith's Association.
